    "_notes": [
      "HTM(SEC 20-F)无物理页码：所有page=0。报表位于F-4/F-5(资产负债表)、F-6(综合收益表)、F-10/F-11(现金流量表)；指标位于Item 5 MD&A（经营利润率与交付量见'Year Ended December 31, 2025 Compared to Year Ended December 31, 2024'节，现金储备见Item 5.B Liquidity and Capital Resources）。",
      "单位：表头'(All amounts in thousands, except for share and per share data)'，取RMB列（2025 US$列为便利换算，忽略）→unit=thousand,currency=CNY；EPS为人民币元/股→yuan_per_share。",
      "符号约定：按原文列报符号，括号=负数（成本/费用/现金流出为负；FY2025经营亏损、经营/投资现金流为负）。capex取现金流量表'Purchase of property, plant and equipment and intangible assets and land use rights'行（负值）；MD&A以正数表述资本开支RMB4.2/7.7 billion，数值一致。",
      "科目映射：short_term_investments←'Time deposits and short-term investments'（定期存款及短期投资合并行）；accounts_receivable←'Trade receivable, net'；accounts_payable←'Trade and notes payable'；total_equity←'Total shareholders' equity'（含非控股权益）；net_income_attributable←'Net income attributable to ordinary shareholders of Li Auto Inc.'。",
      "cash_and_short_term_investments取MD&A明示现金储备RMB101.2 billion（含现金及现金等价物、受限制现金、定期存款及短期投资、长期定期存款及理财）；与资产负债表'现金+定期存款及短期投资+受限制现金'=101,239,486千元一致（约整）。",
      "deliveries_total：FY2025=406,343辆、FY2024=500,508辆，出自MD&A收入分析段（原文'decrease in vehicle deliveries from 500,508 vehicles in 2024 to 406,343 vehicles in 2025'）。"
    ]
